# ============================================================
# Ziad's boilerplate .gitignore
# Updated: 20260920T0054Z
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal starting point, reused across all of my projects.
# Intentionally broad: it errs on the side of ignoring too
# much. Treat it as a baseline, not gospel.
#
#/ Judgment call: worth committing in some projects.
#! Trap: matches more than it looks like.
#
# https://feralcreative.dev
# ============================================================

